        "Implements a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server on Cloudflare Workers, eliminating dedicated server infrastructure typically required for WhatsApp automation.",
        "Bridges personal WhatsApp accounts with Google Contacts API to resolve contact names and enable search for Claude AI agents.",
        "Requires single-user self-hosted deployment due to WhatsApp terms-of-service gray areas and sensitive personal credential management."
      ]
